      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Both run steps you defined. What changes is what sets them off — and one small structural consequence: an event has to be caught before it\ncan run.",
